Still in force from the original entry: the evaluation code and docs stay, and a missing verdict stays missing, never recorded as a pass (see also rules-greg-no-false-refusals-2026-11-04 rev 3).

HISTORY, kept for provenance, NOT current instruction. From 2026-11-02, Greg had turned evaluation off until Execution Observability worked. Verbatim, in session-5135 unless noted:
- "EWALUACJA jest tymczasowo wylaczona do czasu implementacji Execution Observability" (2026-11-02);
- "NIE USUWAMY EWALUACJI Z KODU czy z dokumentow";
- "THIS SHIT IS TURNED OFF UNTIL WE GOT THIS WORKING" (Architect3 #308);
- "that should be already a fucking rule in engram memory".
Back then enforcement was off in both stores (epoch 3, allowed_modes=[]).
